static long compressTimeBucket(long timeBucket, int dayStep) {
    // Extract year, month, and day from the timeBucket
    int year = (int) (timeBucket / 10000);
    int month = (int) ((timeBucket % 10000) / 100);
    int day = (int) (timeBucket % 100);

    // Calculate the day of the month adjusted by dayStep
    int adjustedDay = ((day - 1) / dayStep) * dayStep + 1;

    // Return the new time bucket
    return year * 10000 + month * 100 + adjustedDay;
}
```

This method takes a `timeBucket` in the format `YYYYMMDD` and a `dayStep` integer. It calculates a new `timeBucket` where the day is adjusted to the nearest lower multiple of `dayStep` plus one, effectively compressing the day part of the date according to the specified step.

